      "created_at": "2011-12-06T17:14:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Most statements written this way are a one after the other.  However, the “equal to the number of cards discarded by the players this turn” instead of “equal to the number of cards discarded this way” can lead me to believe that, for the remainder of the turn, discarding additional cards causes further damage.  Seems that might be a bit complicated though.</p>",
