      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/d26b3c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-12-06T18:19:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree. They key phrase is “this turn.” So anything else causing players to make additional discards during “this (Villain) turn” would increase the damage dealt by Citizen Tears, regardless of the order in which it happens. At least that’s my interpretation.</p>",
